 ucerne
DESCRIPTION:Fourth edition of HSLU’s AIristoteles series: an EPFL evoluti
 onary psychologist and a psychotherapist discuss what it means when people
  enter long-term relationships with AI bots\, moderated by Stephan Klappro
 th and followed by an apéro.\n\nOrganiser: HSLU Institut für Kommunikati
 on und Marketing (IKM)\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevent
 s.ch/events/airistoteles-4-hslu-lucerne-2026/
