SUMMARY:Von Shift Left nach Shift Values: Qualität unter AI-Native SAFe
LOCATION:ICT Campus Zentralschweiz\, Rösslimatt 52\, Lucerne
DESCRIPTION:A German-language breakfast session with SAFe trainer Thomas Ve
 rasani on quality assurance once AI writes code faster than teams can test
  it: what the ISTQB says about testing AI and AI-generated software\, whet
 her builders and testers should use different models\, and why coverage nu
 mbers do not show value.\n\nOrganiser: Agile Breakfast Luzern (swissICT)\n
 \nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/agile-breakf
 ast-luzern-shift-values-ai-native-safe-2026/
