SUMMARY:Digitaltag Zentralschweiz 2027 — THE DAY AFTER
LOCATION:SPINNEREI Luzern/Emmenbrücke\, Spinnereistrasse 3\, Emmenbrücke 
 (Lucerne)
DESCRIPTION:Central Switzerland’s digital day asks what remains once the 
 AI euphoria fades — which technologies outlast a market correction\, and
  how they reshape work\, value creation\, politics and the line between re
 al and generated content\, debated with voices from business\, research\, 
 education and politics.\n\nOrganiser: digitalswitzerland Zentralschweiz wi
 th Digital & AI Community\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataev
 ents.ch/events/digitaltag-zentralschweiz-the-day-after-2027/
